OL,3,GNEWSAHalloween dispersal order for town
OL,4,
OL,5,FPolice have issued a dispersal order in
OL,6,FDronfield during Halloween following
OL,7,Fconcerns about anti-social behaviour.
OL,9,FThe Section 34 notice will begin at
OL,10,F18:00 GMT on Friday and remain in place
OL,11,Funtil 06:00 on Sunday. It covers
OL,12,FGosforth Fields, Sindelfingen Park and
OL,13,Fthe surrounding area.
OL,15,FThe order gives officers the power to
OL,16,Fdirect groups of two or more people to
OL,17,Fleave the designated area if they are
OL,18,Finvolved in anti-social behaviour, or
OL,19,Fif police believe they are likely to
OL,20,Fcause harassment, alarm or distress to
OL,21,Fothers.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
